asl-parrot (1.14-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Addressed a problem reported by Patrick N2DYI. HamVOIP nodes will
  automatically re-initiate a call following a HANGUP. Now sending a 
  TEXT !!DISCONNECT!! message to initiate a hangup operation.
  * Added CAUSECODE of 16 ("normal clearing") to the HANGUP message.
  * Turned off TALKERID text message to quiet down logs.

 -- Bruce MacKinnon <bruce@mackinnon.com>  Tue, 07 Jun 2026 19:00:00 -0500

